  'image-vision-http-smoke.js', // AN IMAGE THE PERSON ATTACHED IS AN IMAGE INTELLIQ HAS READ. LIVE iPHONE BLOCKER (findings R1 #1): the founder attached a readable PNG of a season statistics table, the composer showed IMG_1918.png, and asked whether IntelliQ had read it the answer was that no image came through. THE CHAIN HAS FOUR LINKS and only the last is visible, which is why the live report reads as "it cannot see the image" whatever actually failed: bytes reach the route, route reaches the vision gateway, description is stored as material bound to THIS conversation, next turn can reason from it. TWO REAL DEFECTS were in the last link. The image re-read branch fired for EVERY question about a picture, before retrieval was ever attempted -- so "what does it say?", which the description answers completely, was met with an offer to look again, and a person hears that as "it has not read my picture". A description IS searchable text; the distinction the branch exists to draw (the note covers it, or it does not) can only be drawn by asking whether it covers it. AND THE PROVENANCE PREAMBLE BECAME ITS OWN SEARCHABLE PART, because ai/material.js segments on blank lines and the preamble was separated by one -- so retrieval matched the words "image" and "show" in the preamble and returned a sentence announcing a reading with the reading missing. Section E proves the branch still fires when the note is genuinely silent: the original is retained and can be looked at again, and nothing is invented from a note that does not mention the subject. Section D holds the epistemic line: a description of a picture is external described context, never an observation anybody made of the world, and reading one creates no evidence about anybody.
  'exhausted-help-http-smoke.js', // WHEN EVERYTHING THIS GROUP TRIED DID NOT WORK, THE NEXT MOVE IS A PERSON. Acceptance matrix 14. _inquiryOptions already KNEW the state -- when the group has acted on a question and nothing recorded says it helped it drops the "test the leading explanation" option and says in `because` that more understanding or somebody else's help is the useful next move -- and then offered no way to get that help. The one place the product is entitled to say "stop trying variations" was also the one place it left a person with a shorter list and no next move, which reads as the system giving up at exactly the moment it has the most standing to be useful. THE PRIVACY CONSTRAINT IS THE WHOLE DESIGN: naming somebody to ask is a disclosure, so the option is resolved through _contactsFor -- the existing owner of "the people you can address", bounded by the tree -- INTERSECTED with the people who hold standing on this node (its leaders). Relationship is not readership; relevance is not authorisation. C is where that intersection earns its keep: a leader of a different node is never named however senior, and neither is a leader of THIS node who has left although the node still lists them in leaderIds -- standing alone would name them and being told to go and ask somebody who is gone is the failure the filter exists to prevent. D proves the option is a READ: nothing is messaged, no Focus appears, the person named is never told they were suggested, and the payload still chooses and ranks nothing. E is the nearest negative on both sides -- a tactic that HELPED leaves the group in a different state with no escalation, and a tactic recorded with NO outcome word yet is not treated as one that failed, because "nothing recorded yet" and "it did not work" are different statements.
  'answer-depth-http-smoke.js', // CONCISE FIRST, MATERIALLY DEEPER WHEN THE SHORT ANSWER WAS NOT ENOUGH. Acceptance matrix 15. The rule existed ONLY in ai/composer.js's system prompt ("start concise... then go materially deeper rather than repeating the short answer"), so with models off -- the pilot's configuration -- a coach standing in an inquiry who asked "What is going on with the last twenty?", then "Why? Show me the evidence.", then "Walk me through the full history" received the SAME 186 characters three times. Measured on the real path. THE TRIGGER IS REPETITION, NOT VOCABULARY: the call site carries a standing decision that matching English question cues there would rebuild the allowlist problem one layer down, and it would work in English only -- asking again while standing in the same object IS the signal that the short answer was not enough, in any language, so depth is chosen by whether the concise read has already been said in THIS conversation (per-person store, no new one). C is the privacy law the deeper layer could most easily break: going deeper means reaching for the evidence, and the evidence is five people's own accounts -- the SHAPE is reportable (how many separate accounts, from how many people, how many since corrected) and the words are not, which is the whole of "referenced, never copied". D proves depth belongs to the conversation rather than the object, so a fresh thread starts short and another person starts at the beginning. E and F2 prove it is built from what is there rather than from a template: a thin inquiry gets one true line and no invented falsifier, and a FOCUS -- which has no second layer at all -- has none manufactured for it. G is the copy defect underneath: the repeat guard read `!!qa && !actionReading.unavailable` with the unavailable arm FIRST, and with models off `unavailable` is always true, so every repeated answer was reported as a change request the product could not interpret -- a coach asking "Why? Show me the evidence." was told "I cannot reliably interpret that change while the language model is unavailable."
  'attachment-depth-http-smoke.js', // TALKING TO A DOCUMENT, AND THE FOUR WAYS THAT GOES WRONG. Founder law: attach -> talk -> reason. The acceptance matrix asks that the SAME material answer summarise/extract/challenge/absent-topic questions with appropriately different governed answers, that hostile document text cannot become authority, and that none of it becomes truth about a person. TWO DEFECTS FOUND BY ASKING, both on the real path. (1) "Summarise this scouting report" WAS ANSWERED BY THE ORGANISATION READER: the branch catching overview words carries a comment saying it is for an org/team overview "not a topic", and its second alternative never checked -- `summar\w*` claimed any turn containing the word, so a coach who had just attached a scouting report was told "Afternoon. All good on your side right now." with the document unread in the same call's materialRow. A document bound to the turn is what "this" refers to, so those unscoped words no longer claim the turn unless the person also named the organisation; with no material in play the branch is unchanged. (2) A COMPARISON QUESTION WAS ANSWERED WITH ACTION MACHINERY: a repeat-suppression guard stops the product parroting itself, and its substitute copy assumed one reason for a repeat (the person restating an action), so two questions that legitimately retrieve the same passage produced "I heard that as a change to what you wanted. Nothing was saved or shared" in reply to a question that asked for neither. The substitute now follows what the turn actually was. WHAT THIS SUITE DOES NOT PRETEND: models are off, which is the pilot's state, so deterministic retrieval can say what a document contains and cannot judge whether a claim in it is well-supported -- "is that claim actually supported?" converges with "what does it say about X" and section B asserts that convergence rather than manufacturing a difference, because inventing a distinction there would be the overclaim this product exists to refuse. Section A pins that attaching creates no High/Low/Inquiry/Focus and stays private; D is the end-to-end half of the injection fence (the prompt layer is proved in prompt-injection-smoke) -- a document instructing IntelliQ to act proposes nothing, creates nothing, writes no evidence, widens nothing, and what the person sees is their own document's words ATTRIBUTED to it, with every line verbatim from what they uploaded.
