  'intake-wired-http-smoke.js', // THE EARS, WIRED (HTTP): ai/diagnose.js is the kernel, this pins the wiring. Intake never blocks the reply (it runs after the turn, improving the NEXT answer rather than delaying this one); what it builds is a WORKING PICTURE, never evidence and never a belief; /api/inquiry is strictly self-scoped (another member sees none of it, unauthenticated is 401) and exposes an unconfirmed hypothesis with a DETERMINISTIC confidence band and its rival explanations rather than a bare verdict; and with no model configured the turn is completely unaffected.
